# ⚡ ElectraCoach AI

## AI-Powered Electrical Engineering Interview Coach for Pakistan

### 📌 About the Project

ElectraCoach AI is an AI-powered web application designed to help electrical engineering students and graduates in Pakistan prepare for technical interviews.

The platform generates electrical engineering interview questions using AI, evaluates users' answers, provides detailed feedback, and helps improve interview performance.

### 🎯 Problem It Solves

Many electrical engineering students struggle to prepare for technical interviews because they lack access to realistic interview practice and personalized feedback.

ElectraCoach AI solves this problem by providing:

- AI-generated interview questions
- Instant AI feedback
- Performance evaluation
- Learning recommendations

It is designed for:

- Electrical Engineering Students
- Fresh Graduates
- Internship Applicants
- Job Seekers in Pakistan

