# ⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mhamzahamidi-boop/electrical-ai-coach.git
```

Go to project folder

```bash
cd electrical-ai-coach
```

Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

Create environment file

```
.env.local
```

Add your API Key

```
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY
```

Run the project

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open

```
http://localhost:3000
```

